// title: Threat Intelligence Data from Sentinel UEBA2
// date: 2026-10-23
// product: Sentinel
// tables: BehaviorAnalytics
// purpose: Threat Intelligence Data from Sentinel UEBA2
// source: https://github.com/SlimKQL/Hunting-Queries-Detection-Rules/blob/9c838dc165ac602c525321c6f475e5c90f2fd7d2/Sentinel/Threat%20Intelligence%20Data%20from%20Sentinel%20UEBA2.kql
// kind: repo
